    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRAZIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Brazil is Eumir Deodato's country of origin and primary area of musical influence."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORDING CAREER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Eumir Deodato's recording career began in the 1970s and has spanned numerous collaborations and productions."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARRANGING AND PRODUCING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Eumir Deodato is known for arranging and producing music for various artists."</data>
