    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIMITATIONS IN MUSIC PRODUCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"There were limitations in music production before digital technology, such as not being able to instantly sample pieces of songs."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIGITAL TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Digital technology has revolutionized music production, allowing for instant sampling and other advanced techniques."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNDERSTANDING LIMITATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Understanding the limitations of music production helps in overcoming them and achieving better results."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLLECTIVE INTROSPECTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The team engaged in collective introspection about their role in responding to the unknown intelligence."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MESSAGE FROM THE HEAVENS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The message from the heavens is a significant event that prompted the team to respond and prepare."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e</data>
    </node>
